@startuml
title UC-06: Product image choice
start
:Seller adds product image;
if (Mode?) then (LINK)
  :Validate approved HTTPS URL, source and license;
  :Store URL metadata only;
  :Browser fetches source live;
else (UPLOAD)
  :Validate signature, dimensions and size;
  :Store bytes and metadata in PostgreSQL;
  :Serve through same-origin content route;
endif
if (Image loaded?) then (yes)
  :Show product image;
else (no)
  :Show local placeholder;
endif
stop
@enduml
